{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_221_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_221","textTraditional":"一、九年。春王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_221_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_221","textTraditional":"二、夏四月戊申，鄭伯囆卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_221_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_221","textTraditional":"三、得寶玉、大弓。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_221_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_221","textTraditional":"何以書？國寶也，喪之書，得之書。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_221_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_221","textTraditional":"四、六月，葬鄭獻公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_221_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_221","textTraditional":"五、秋，齊侯、衞侯次于五氏。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_221_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_221","textTraditional":"六、秦伯卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_221_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_221","textTraditional":"七、冬，葬秦哀公。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}